{{Quote|text=Eek! A stranger! W-wait. Aren't you [Farmer's Name], the new farmer? Sorry. I get a little nervous around people I haven't met before... My name is Sophia. I'm the owner of Blue Moon Vineyard. Um... well, I'll see you around, I guess.}}
'''Sophia''' is a [[Villagers|villager]] who lives at [[Blue Moon Vineyard]] west of [[Pelican Town]]. She is one of the 7 marriage candidates added by Stardew Valley Expanded.

Sophia is a farmer, managing her estate, Blue Moon Vineyard. She is shy, but upbeat with her friends. Her hobbies include watching anime, reading manga, and cosplaying.

