{{HeartsTableRowDesc|1 = A choice.|2=The player enters Blue Moon Vineyard and sees a conversation between Sophia and Scarlett taking place. After they finish, Sophia asks if the player heard what they were talking about.<br>* {{Choice|"I didn't hear anything."|50}} Sophia says to keep anything the farmer hears to themselves, before she returns to her house.
* {{Choice|"Something about a medicine?"|-50}} Sophia will start crying and run back to her house.}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

===Hearts: 4===
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" data-expandtext="❇ Show ❇" data-collapsetext="✖ Hide ✖">{{Hearts|4}} <div class=mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder></div>
