{{HeartsTableRow|1 = Season:|2 = {{Season|Spring}}, {{Season|Summer}}, or {{Season|Fall}}}}
{{HeartsTableRow|1 = Weather:|2 = {{Weather inline|Sun|size=32}}}}
{{HeartsTableRow|1 = Conditions:| 2 = Must have seen her 2-hearts event}}
{{HeartsTableRowDesc|1 = Becoming friends.|2=The player enters Pelican Town and sees Sophia coming out of Harvey's Clinic. She greets the player and starts a conversation.<br>
* {{Choice|"Hey, how are you doing"|0}} She'll begin to cry as she tries to keep the conversation going. The player receives the message "I should do something to cheer up Sophia..." and is given options for what to say next:
**{{Choice|"Wanna go pet Dusty with me?"|50}} Sophia will agree and have a good time petting Dusty and laughing. After the event ends Sophia will thank the player and say it helped in cheering her up.
**{{Choice|"Wanna go get food at the Saloon with me?"|50}} Sophia will agree and go to the Saloon with the player. There, she asks Gus for her favorite dish. Gus then will secretly tell the player it's on the house. After the event ends, Sophia thanks the player and says it helped in cheering her up.
* {{Choice|"I want to know what you were doing at the hospital"|-50}} Sophia will start crying and will run away, leaving the player behind.}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

